@format 1
@id section-creation.common.compass-buttons
@title Compass buttons
@section Section creation
@area Common
@entry add-button,start-button,split-button,end-button
@summary Map the four Split Compass buttons that can initiate section creation and their direct dispatch into the corresponding creation command.
@related section-creation.add-at-cursor, section-creation.set-start-creates-section, section-creation.set-end-creates-section, section-creation.split-selected-section
@tag section
@tag split
@tag creation
@tag compass

@alias compass = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PCompass
@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[add-button] Add button Click <input>
- The Split Compass creates an Add button whose Click lambda invokes the supplied addSection action @ compass.PCompass(...) / Add button Click lambda
> add-dispatch

[start-button] Start button Click <input>
- The Split Compass creates a Start button whose Click lambda invokes the supplied setStart action @ compass.PCompass(...) / Start button Click lambda
> start-dispatch

[split-button] Split button Click <input>
- The Split Compass creates a Split button whose Click lambda invokes the supplied splitSection action @ compass.PCompass(...) / Split button Click lambda
> split-dispatch

[end-button] End button Click <input>
- The Split Compass creates an End button whose Click lambda invokes the supplied setEnd action @ compass.PCompass(...) / End button Click lambda
> end-dispatch

[add-dispatch] Submit addSection to the active flow <process>
- Invoke PFlowShortcutDispatch with addSection; the called map begins at that dispatch request @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / addSection
> map:section-creation.add-at-cursor

[start-dispatch] Submit setStart to the active flow <process>
- Invoke PFlowShortcutDispatch with setStart; only its creation branch is followed by the called map @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / setStart
> map:section-creation.set-start-creates-section

[split-dispatch] Submit splitSection to the active flow <process>
- Invoke PFlowShortcutDispatch with splitSection; the called map follows only successful section division @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / splitSection
> map:section-creation.split-selected-section

[end-dispatch] Submit setEnd to the active flow <process>
- Invoke PFlowShortcutDispatch with setEnd; only its creation branch is followed by the called map @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...) / setEnd
> map:section-creation.set-end-creates-section
